    "ref_issue": {
      "assets": [],
      "assignee": null,
      "assignees": null,
      "body": "Add an API test that encodes audio frames with the CNG encoder and feeds the resulting SID packets to the decoder. Both cngdec.c and cngenc.c had 0% line coverage                                                                                                                         \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      Coverage after this patch:                                                                                                                                                                 \n - libavcodec/cngdec.c: 0% -> 93.75% (75/80 lines)                                                                                                                                          \n - libavcodec/cngenc.c: 0% -> 89.47% (34/38 lines)                                                                                                                                          \n                                                                                                                                                                                             \n Remaining uncovered lines are OOM error paths.                                                                                                                                             \n                                                                                                                                                                                             \n Signed-off-by: Soham Kute <officialsohamkute@gmail.com>",
